---
/**
 * Standalone document for the fictional print shop.
 * Does not load the team-site layout or global.css.
 * The sample bar, header, and footer live here.
 */
interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
}

const { title, description } = Astro.props;
const phone = '000-0000-0000';
const phoneHref = 'tel:00000000000';
const nav = [
  { href: '#works', label: '仕事' },
  { href: '#flow', label: '注文の流れ' },
  { href: '#price', label: '料金' },
  { href: '#about', label: 'お店について' },
] as const;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f0e6" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">本文へ進む</a>
    <div class="top">
      <div class="bar" role="note">
        <p class="bar-main">
          <span class="badge">架空のサンプル</span>
          <span class="bar-long">「ひなた堂印刷」は実在しません。写真は AI で生成した画像です。</span>
          <span class="bar-short">実在しません。写真はAI生成です。</span>
        </p>
        <p class="bar-links">
          <a href="/">michixsa のトップへ戻る</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <header class="head">
        <a class="brand" href="/lp/hinata/">
          <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">ひ</span>
          <span class="brand-text">
            <span class="brand-name">ひなた堂印刷</span>
            <span class="brand-tag">チラシ・名刺・封筒の印刷</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="head-end">
          <nav class="nav" aria-label="ページ内">
            {
              nav.map((item) => (
                <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>
              ))
            }
          </nav>
          <a class="tel" href={phoneHref}>{phone}</a>
          <a class="btn" href="#contact">相談する</a>
          <details class="menu">
            <summary>
              <span class="menu-word">メニュー</span>
              <span class="menu-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="menu-panel">
              {
                nav.map((item) => (
                  <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>
                ))
              }
              <a href={phoneHref}>{phone}</a>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </header>
    </div>
    <main id="main">
      <slot />
    </main>
    <footer class="foot">
      <div class="foot-grid">
        <div class="foot-brand">
          <div class="foot-name-row">
            <span class="mark mark-on-ink" aria-hidden="true">ひ</span>
            <p class="foot-name">ひなた堂印刷</p>
          </div>
          <p class="foot-tag">チラシ・名刺・封筒の印刷</p>
          <p class="foot-invite">用紙と部数の目安は、データをもらえればお返しします。</p>
          <a class="btn btn-on-ink" href="#contact">相談する</a>
        </div>
        <div class="foot-block">
          <h2>営業時間と所在</h2>
          <p class="foot-caption">営業時間は、見本のための架空のものです。</p>
          <table class="hours">
            <caption class="sr">営業時間（架空）</caption>
            <tbody>
              <tr><th scope="row">平日</th><td>9:00–18:00</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">土曜</th><td>9:00–15:00</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">日曜・祝日</th><td>休み</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          <p class="foot-addr">〒000-0000 架空県架空市ひなた1-2-3</p>
          <p>電話 <a href={phoneHref}>{phone}</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="foot-block">
          <h2>店までの目印</h2>
          <figure class="guide">
            <figcaption>案内図（架空です。実在の場所ではありません。）</figcaption>
            <ol class="guide-path">
              <li>架空駅<br />北口</li>
              <li>通りを北へ<br />徒歩約8分</li>
              <li>交番の先を右</li>
              <li class="here">ひなた堂</li>
            </ol>
            <p>架空駅の北口を出て、通りを北へ徒歩約8分。交番の先を右に折れると、紙の束が見える小さな作業場です。</p>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="foot-bottom">
        <div class="foot-notes">
          <p>「ひなた堂印刷」は実在しません。</p>
          <p>写真は AI で生成した画像です。</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/">michixsa のトップへ戻る</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
    <script>
      const menu = document.querySelector('.menu');
      if (menu instanceof HTMLDetailsElement) {
        menu.querySelectorAll('a').forEach((anchor) => {
          anchor.addEventListener('click', () => {
            menu.open = false;
          });
        });
      }
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    --paper: #f4f0e6;
    --surface: #fffdf8;
    --ink: #1c1b18;
    --muted: #5a554c;
    --on-ink: #f4f0e6;
    --on-ink-muted: #c4b8a6;
    --line: #7f786c;
    --rust: #5c2e18;
    --bar: #1e3a5f;
    --focus: #5c2e18;
    --serif: "Hiragino Mincho ProN", "Hiragino Mincho Pro", "Yu Mincho", YuMincho, "Hiragino Mincho", "Noto Serif CJK JP", "Noto Serif JP", "MS PMincho", serif;
    --sans: "Hiragino Sans", "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", "BIZ UDPGothic", "Noto Sans JP", "Noto Sans CJK JP", "Yu Gothic", YuGothic, Meiryo, sans-serif;
  }
  /* Measured contrast (WCAG): ink/paper 15.13, ink/surface 16.94,
     on-ink/ink 15.13, on-ink-muted/ink 8.82, muted/paper 6.50,
     muted/surface 7.28, muted/ink 2.33 (not used on ink),
     line/paper 3.84, line/surface 4.30, white/rust 11.30, rust/paper 9.93,
     rust/ink 1.52 (not used on ink), white/bar 11.50.
     Focus on the bar, the ink panel, and the footer uses --on-ink. */
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-padding-top: 168px; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  img { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
  picture { display: block; }
  p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
  h1, h2, h3, .brand-name, .foot-name, .mark {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
    font-feature-settings: "palt";
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: clamp(44px, 3.5vw + 32px, 72px);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  /* Each phrase stays on one line. The only break is between the two spans. */
  h1 span {
    display: block;
    white-space: nowrap;
    word-break: keep-all;
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 1.5vw + 26px, 44px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 0.6vw + 18px, 24px);
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  a { color: var(--rust); }
  a:visited { color: var(--rust); }
  :focus { outline: none; }
  :focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--focus);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .skip {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }
  .skip:focus-visible {
    position: fixed;
    top: 8px;
    left: 8px;
    z-index: 80;
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    overflow: visible;
    clip: auto;
    white-space: normal;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    min-height: 48px;
  }

  .top {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 40;
    background: var(--paper);
  }
  .bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0 16px;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    background: var(--bar);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .bar-main, .bar-links { margin: 0; }
  .bar-main {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    min-height: 32px;
    padding: 6px 0;
  }
  .bar-long { display: none; }
  .bar-short { white-space: nowrap; }
  .bar-links { flex: 1 0 100%; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 22px;
    padding: 0 8px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--bar);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .bar-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0 12px;
  }
  .bar a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .bar a:visited { color: #fff; }
  .bar a:focus-visible { outline-color: #fff; }
  .sr {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }
  .head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 72px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    background: var(--paper);
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--line) 45%, var(--paper));
  }
  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 48px;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .brand:visited { color: var(--ink); }
  .mark {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--rust);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .brand-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-width: 0; }
  .brand-name {
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .brand-tag { display: none; }
  .head-end { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; }
  .nav { display: none; }
  .nav a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 4px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .nav a:visited { color: var(--ink); }
  .nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 6px; }
  .nav a[aria-current='location'] {
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 6px;
  }
  .tel {
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 4px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .tel:visited { color: var(--ink); }
  .menu { position: relative; }
  .menu summary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 48px;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink);
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .menu summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .menu-icon { display: none; }
  .menu-panel {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    top: calc(100% + 8px);
    right: 0;
    width: min(280px, calc(100vw - 24px));
    padding: 8px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .menu-panel a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .menu-panel a:visited { color: var(--ink); }
  @media (max-width: 359px) {
    .menu summary { width: 48px; padding: 0; }
    .menu-word {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      padding: 0;
      margin: -1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
      white-space: nowrap;
      border: 0;
    }
    .menu-icon {
      display: block;
      width: 18px;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--ink);
      box-shadow: 0 -6px 0 var(--ink), 0 6px 0 var(--ink);
    }
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 14px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--rust);
    color: #fff;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .btn-on-ink,
  .btn-on-ink:visited {
    background: var(--on-ink);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .btn:visited { color: #fff; }
  .btn-on-ink:visited { color: var(--ink); }
  .btn:hover { opacity: 0.88; }
  .text-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    color: var(--rust);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .text-link:visited { color: var(--rust); }
  .text-link:hover { opacity: 0.84; }
  .btn, .text-link, .brand:hover { transition: opacity 0.15s ease; }
  .brand:hover { opacity: 0.84; }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: calc(100svh - 154px);
    background: var(--ink);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-photo {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: #e4dece;
  }
  .hero-photo picture,
  .hero-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: none;
  }
  .hero-photo img {
    object-fit: cover;
    /* Wall is the top of hero-sp. Keep the bench and cutter in the lower half. */
    object-position: center 72%;
  }
  .hero-panel {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 16px 16px 20px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--on-ink);
  }
  .hero-panel .kicker {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: var(--on-ink-muted);
    font-size: clamp(14px, 0.2vw + 13px, 16px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .hero-panel .lead {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: var(--on-ink-muted);
    font-size: clamp(18px, 0.3vw + 17px, 20px);
    line-height: 1.7;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .hero-panel .text-link,
  .hero-panel .text-link:visited {
    color: var(--on-ink);
  }
  .hero-panel :focus-visible { outline-color: var(--on-ink); }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px 16px;
  }
  .swatch {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    display: flex;
    height: 12px;
  }
  .swatch span { flex: 1 1 0; }
  .swatch span:nth-child(1) { background: #f7f4ee; }
  .swatch span:nth-child(2) { background: #e6dcc8; }
  .swatch span:nth-child(3) { background: #c5d0d8; }
  .swatch span:nth-child(4) { background: #d7c4c0; }
  .swatch span:nth-child(5) { background: #c5cdc0; }
  .swatch span:nth-child(6) { background: #5c2e18; }

  .section { padding: 80px 0; }
  .section-surface { background: var(--surface); }
  .wrap {
    width: min(72rem, calc(100% - 32px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .narrow {
    width: min(40rem, calc(100% - 32px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .intro { max-width: 40rem; margin: 0 0 24px; }

  .works {
    display: grid;
    gap: 32px;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .work-card img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: #e4dece;
  }
  .work-card h3 { margin-top: 16px; }
  .work-card p { margin: 0; }
  #works { padding-bottom: 0; }
  .stack { margin: 32px 0 0; }
  .stack img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    background: #e4dece;
  }

  .section-ink {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--on-ink);
    padding: 80px 0;
  }
  .section-ink :focus-visible { outline-color: var(--on-ink); }
  .flow {
    display: grid;
    gap: 40px;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .flow li { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .flow-num {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: var(--on-ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: clamp(64px, 5vw + 44px, 96px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .flow h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: var(--on-ink);
    font-size: clamp(22px, 0.8vw + 19px, 28px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .flow p { margin: 0; color: var(--on-ink-muted); }

  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  caption {
    padding: 0 0 8px;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 12px 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  th { font-weight: 700; }
  .money { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
  .notice { margin: 0 0 16px; font-weight: 700; }
  .after { margin: 16px 0 0; }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .about-photo { order: -1; }
  .about-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: #e4dece;
  }
  .about-copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .about-copy table { margin-top: 8px; }
  .about-copy a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .faq { margin: 0; }
  .faq dt {
    margin: 16px 0 8px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(20px, 0.6vw + 18px, 24px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    font-feature-settings: "palt";
  }
  .faq dt:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: 0;
  }
  .faq dd { margin: 0 0 8px; }

  .field { margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .field label { display: block; margin: 0 0 4px; font-weight: 700; }
  input, textarea {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink);
    font: inherit;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  input { min-height: 48px; padding: 0 12px; }
  textarea { min-height: 144px; padding: 12px; resize: vertical; }
  .live { min-height: 1.7em; margin: 16px 0 0; font-weight: 700; }

  .foot {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--on-ink);
    padding: 64px 16px 48px;
  }
  .foot :focus-visible { outline-color: var(--on-ink); }
  .foot-grid { display: grid; gap: 48px; }
  .foot-brand { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
  .foot-name-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .mark-on-ink {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: var(--on-ink);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 24px;
  }
  .foot-name {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 32px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .foot-tag, .foot-invite, .foot-caption, .guide p, .foot-notes {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--on-ink-muted);
    font-size: 16px;
  }
